# Internal, never deployed.
#
# This repository deploys its root directory statically, so anything committed
# here is otherwise publicly fetchable. commerce/ holds the internal JUMVI
# Product Truth source, platform drafts and the validator - working material,
# not site content. Excluding it here keeps it out of every deployment
# (production and preview) rather than relying on robots directives, which
# would still leave the files downloadable.
commerce/
